packages/kernel/src/dmath/ is a TypeScript transcription of the fdlibm
polynomial kernels. It exists because ECMAScript leaves the results of
Math.sin, Math.cos, Math.pow and the other transcendental functions
implementation-defined, so a simulation that must replay bit-exactly on
another engine cannot call them.
